From f6857d4bfd614b90302903490796ef376be0a67d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jiajun Leng <adolphpi@outlook.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 20:19:32 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 252/252] platform/x86: oxpec: add OneXPlayer X2 Mini (G3E) DMI
 entry

The OneXPlayer X2 Mini (G3E) is the Intel variant and reports DMI board
name "ONEXPLAYER X2Mini". Map it to oxp_g1_i, the Intel profile already
used by the ONEXPLAYER G1 i in this tree; upstream additionally maps the
ONEXPLAYER 3 to the same profile. Fan reading, manual PWM and charging
control work.

Signed-off-by: Jiajun Leng <adolphpi@outlook.com>
---
 drivers/platform/x86/oxpec.c | 7 +++++++
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/platform/x86/oxpec.c b/drivers/platform/x86/oxpec.c
index 5680c3bcd604..08b42a38c4c1 100644
--- a/drivers/platform/x86/oxpec.c
+++ b/drivers/platform/x86/oxpec.c
@@ -294,6 +294,13 @@ static const struct dmi_system_id dmi_table[] = {
 		},
 		.driver_data = (void *)oxp_x1,
 	},
+	{
+		.matches = {
+			DMI_MATCH(DMI_BOARD_VENDOR, "ONE-NETBOOK"),
+			DMI_EXACT_MATCH(DMI_BOARD_NAME, "ONEXPLAYER X2Mini"),
+		},
+		.driver_data = (void *)oxp_g1_i,
+	},
 	{
 		.matches = {
 			DMI_MATCH(DMI_BOARD_VENDOR, "ONE-NETBOOK"),
-- 
2.56.0

